<!doctype html>
<html lang="vi"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title>ĐK ViewPhone · LAN Viewer</title><style id="dk-theme">:root{font-family:Segoe UI,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#203452;background:#f3f7fc;color-scheme:light;--blue:#2563eb;--line:#dce5f1}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;height:100dvh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}button,input{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:white;color:#304767;padding:10px 15px;font-weight:600}button:hover{background:#eef4ff}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #86b4ff;outline-offset:2px}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}.primary{background:var(--blue);color:white;border-color:var(--blue)}.primary:hover{background:#1d4ed8}header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;background:white;padding:16px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:750;white-space:nowrap}.logo{display:grid;place-items:center;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:11px;color:white;background:var(--blue)}.device{min-width:0;flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.device strong{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;font-size:14px}.device span{color:#71819a;font-size:12px}.status{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:13px;color:#697c97}.dot{width:8px;height:8px;background:#94a3b8;border-radius:50%}.online .dot{background:#16a979}.online{color:#158166}.notice{padding:9px 28px;font-size:12px;color:#785518;background:#fff8e7;border-bottom:1px solid #f3e3b5}.notice.secure{color:#22765d;background:#effaf5;border-color:#d7efe2}.workspace{flex:1;min-height:0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;margin:20px 28px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:#eaf0f8;background-image:radial-gradient(#ccd9ea .8px,transparent .8px);background-size:16px 16px;box-shadow:0 5px 30px #2c497608}.screen{width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto}.empty{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;pointer-events:none}.empty>div{max-width:340px;padding:25px}.empty .phone{margin:0 auto 18px;border:3px solid #9bb4d6;border-radius:15px;width:55px;height:88px}.empty h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:650}.empty p{font-size:14px;color:#71819a;line-height:1.7}.toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:15px;padding:0 28px 20px}.toolbar label{font-size:13px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}.toolbar input{accent-color:var(--blue)}.metrics{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:#71819a}.message{margin:0 28px 10px;min-height:20px;color:#526b8b;font-size:13px}dialog{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:28px;max-width:410px;width:calc(100% - 30px);box-shadow:0 24px 80px #162d5a30}dialog::backdrop{background:#14284555;backdrop-filter:blur(3px)}dialog h2{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:21px}dialog p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667d9b}dialog input[type=password]{display:block;width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px;border-radius:9px;margin:12px 0 18px}dialog .actions{display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px}[hidden]{display:none!important}#workspace:fullscreen{margin:0;border:0;border-radius:0;background:#101c2e}@media(max-width:650px){header{gap:12px;padding:12px 15px}.brand .wordmark{display:none}.workspace{margin:12px}.toolbar{padding:0 12px 12px;gap:10px}.notice{padding:8px 15px}.message{margin:0 15px 8px}.metrics{width:100%;margin-left:0}}
</style><script defer src="viewer.bundle.js"></script>
</head><body data-rfb-port="$PORT">
<header><div class="brand"><span class="logo" aria-hidden="true">ĐK</span><span class="wordmark">ĐK ViewPhone</span></div>
<div class="device"><strong id="deviceName">iPhone · LAN Viewer</strong><span id="address"></span></div>
<div id="status" class="status" role="status"><span class="dot"></span><span id="state">Chưa kết nối</span></div><button id="headerDisconnect" disabled>Disconnect</button></header>
<div class="notice" id="transport"></div>
<main class="workspace" id="workspace"><div id="screen" class="screen" aria-label="Màn hình iPhone"></div>
<div id="empty" class="empty"><div><div class="phone"></div><h1>iPhone, ngay trên máy tính.</h1><p>Nhấn Connect để xem và điều khiển. Chỉ hỏi mật khẩu nếu iPhone bật xác thực VNC. Chế độ không mật khẩu cho phép mọi người truy cập được máy trong LAN kết nối.</p></div></div></main>
<div id="message" class="message" role="status"></div>
<footer class="toolbar"><button class="primary" id="connect">Connect</button><button id="disconnect" disabled>Disconnect</button><button id="fullscreen">Fullscreen</button>
<label><input id="viewOnly" type="checkbox">View-only</label><label><input id="autoScale" type="checkbox" checked>Auto Scale</label><label><input id="reconnect" type="checkbox" checked>Reconnect</label>
<span class="metrics" title="noVNC hiện tại không xuất số đo FPS và độ trễ chính xác; không hiển thị số ước đoán.">FPS — · Latency —</span></footer>
<dialog id="login"><form id="loginForm"><h2>Kết nối iPhone</h2><p>Nhập mật khẩu VNC trong Settings → ĐK ViewPhone. Dùng mật khẩu chỉ xem nếu bạn không cần điều khiển.</p>
<label for="password">Mật khẩu VNC</label><input id="password" type="password" required autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" maxlength="8">
<div class="actions"><button type="button" id="cancel">Hủy</button><button type="submit" class="primary">Kết nối</button></div></form></dialog>
</body></html>
